y runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025, October to November came in at 56% and November to December at 31% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 36%. Grid 18492 had its driest year in 2007 at 60%.</p>"}
